s auch bei </strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/retrokompott\">Twitter</a>, </strong><strong>auf </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/retrokompott/?fref=ts\">Facebook</a>, </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><strong>oder auf unser </strong><strong><a href=\"http://www.retrokompott.de\">Homepage</a></strong><strong>.</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></span></div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Die Links aus dem Podcast:</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a> </span></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid74\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"><a href=\"https://ideas.lego.com/projects/78561\" target=\"_blank\">Lego Kickstarter</a> </span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid77\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75958\"><a href=\"http://www.amiga-news.de/de/news/AN-2015-08-00051-DE.html\" target=\"_blank\">Amiga Treffen in Berlin </a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid78\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> <span class=\"author-p-75958\"> <a href=\"http://www.petrosbook.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Biographie von Tyschtschenko</a>: </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid93\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
